<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2TI" style="id">- Bekwel Bible</book>
  <para style="h">2 Timote</para>
  <para style="toc3">2Tm</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Timote</para>
  <para style="toc1">Mɛkana ɛ Pɔl yii Bhɔɔba nyɛ nakwyal Timote ɛ</para>
  <para style="mt2">Mɛkana ɛ Pɔl yii Bhɔɔba nyɛ nakwyal</para>
  <para style="mt1">Timote ɛ</para>
  <para style="imt">Ɛniel</para>
  <para style="ip">Mɛkana mɛ bhɔɔba nakyeedaa pɛ daa Timote ɛ, ye nabɛ ɛ́ elwomel e mɛsik ɛ Pɔl mot-lwoma. Pɔl ɛ́ é membok (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2TI 2:9">2.9</ref></char>), ye nabɛ ɛ́ bɛtɛ nɛ bot naaliig nyɛ koŋ (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2TI 1:15">1.15</ref>; <ref loc="2TI 4:10-16">4.10-16</ref></char>). Tin, nyɛ nabɛ ɛ́ nyɛ eezegu náá, nyɛ moo aagwyɛ (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2TI 4:6">4.6</ref></char>). Nyɛ naamwana nɛ Timote mot nadi egyee nɛ nɛ tɔ mɛsa ɔ, mot nyɛ nadi ekwyɛl dáa mɔn'ɛ ɔ.</para>
  <para style="ip">Mɛkana mak kaada ɛ́ tsik ɛ Pɔl: mɛsa mɛ yii mot-lwoma, mɛlyo mɛ, mezuk mɛ kɔ ɛsu ɛ Mbɛɛ Bhaadal. Pɔl ɛpedjɛ mɛlyo nɛ Timote. Nyɛ ɛpedjɛ nyɛ mɛghaaz náá, nyɛ waaboma nɛ mezuk kɔ ɛsu ɛ mɛsa ɛ Klisto nyɛ di esa ɛ (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2TI 2:1-13">2.1-13</ref></char>). Bhii tak, nyɛ ɛpebaalɛɛ náá, nyɛ goola Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb ɛnyɔɛpe (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2TI 2:14-4:15">2.14–4.15</ref></char>). Dum nɛ tɛp tak, Timote goka ɛ́ nɛ ɛkaab ɛ́ mɛwɔ, ɛlum bot ɛ mesyem koŋ, ɛbaŋa mɛfulu ɛ Pɔl. Ɛsok nɛ etɛp djas, nyɛ goka ɛ́ nɛ ɛdi sosoob nɛ mɛlyo mɛ Pɔl nɛ yii bɛdhiiti bɛlyoel ekeletyɛ nalyo nyɛ ɛ.</para>
  <para style="ip">Bhis eboo bɛtyaasɛs ɛ Yezu aagwyɛ ɛ́, bot ɛ nadjila bɛ é mɛsa mɛ etyaasɛs ɔ, nabaazokɛ ɛ́ dáa bɔɔ. Yɛ ɛ́ deenek ɛ́, <char style="em">bɛ nabaal mɛkpa</char> mɛ bɛ nagwak nɛ bɛlyoel bɔɔ ɛ ɛnyɔɛpe. Tin, bɛ baagoka ɛ́ nɛ ɛlaa bɛmɛkana mɛ na Dɛɛ. É ghɛŋ Pɔl nakwyal Timote bɛmɛkana ɛ, é ghɛŋ tak, bɛmɛkana ɛ Zɛɛb nadi ɛ́, yii Ɛbhɛŋ ɛ na Mwa, nɛghu ba bɛdhiiti bɔɔ epes e bɛmɛkana mɛ Ɛbhɛŋ ɛ na Bes. Ekwyala bak djas ɛ́ «nɛ boo mɛtaŋ étɛp ɛlyo bot etsɛɛtsɛ, étɛp ɛsa náá, bot myaal, étɛp ɛkoobal embee mɛsa mɔɔ, étɛp ɛsa náá, mot di nɛ tsik epiki» (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2TI 3:16">3.16</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="ie" />
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2TI 1" />
  <para style="s">Mɛswosel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 1:1" />Yɛ ɛ́ mam, Pɔl mot-lwoma ɛ Yezu Klisto tɔ ɛkwosak ɛ Zɛɛb. Mɛ ɛ́ wak ɛ́ étɛp ɛgoola bin tsik. Yɛ ɛ́ tsik ɛ Zɛɛb djɛ mena kɔ ɛsu ɛgwakel ɛ lena nɛ Yezu Klisto ɛ.<verse eid="2TI 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 1:2" />Mɛ kwyal mɛkana mak ɛ́ nɛ wɔy Timote mɔn'am mɛ di ekwyɛl ɔ: beta náá, enɛm nɛ embɛɛ, nɛ lyem ghoŋ, nɛ egwyem ɛ Zɛɛb Sɛɛg bɛ nɛ Ghɛŋ'enaka Yezu Klisto di nɛ nɔ.<verse eid="2TI 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pɔl ɛpebulal bhɔɔ nɛ Zɛɛb kɔ ɛsu ɛ Timote</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 1:3" />Mɛ ɛpebulal bhɔɔ nɛ Zɛɛb, mot mɛ di esa mɛsa mɛ nɛ lyem sɛŋ dáa bɛbhaab'am nasa ɛ. Mwos nɛ pum é sok mɛ di edjaala Zɛɛb ɛ, mɛ nɛ dyeebadjaala étɛp'ɔ. <verse eid="2TI 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 1:4" />Mɛ ɛpetaala meŋal mɔ, é di'enek, mɛ ɛ́ nɛ gwyes ɛbee wɔ, étɛp lyem'am neelwood nɛ mɛmyaala. <verse eid="2TI 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 1:5" />Mɛ ɛpebaataala dɔɔ nɛ ɛdum ɛ koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb, wɔ zedum nɛ lyem wat ɛ. Yɛ ɛ́ kɔkɔ mbi ɛdum ɛ koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb yii naye yɔ Loyis nɛ nyoog Enis nadi nɛ yɛ ɛ. Mɛ eemyaal náá, kɔkɔ mbi ɛdum ɛ koŋ ɛlenek ɛ́ tɔ lɔ.<verse eid="2TI 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ɛzuk sama nɛ nam kɔ ɛsu ɛ Mbɛɛ Bhaadal</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 1:6" />Yɛ ɛ́ étɛp tak ɛ mɛ baadi elɛɛ nɛ nɔ náá: sa náá, ɛkɛɛ ɛ Zɛɛb nadjɛ wɔ é sok mɛ nakɛl wɔ mɛmbɔ ɛ di nɛ tsik. <verse eid="2TI 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 1:7" />Etɛɛ náá, Sisim Zɛɛb nadjɛ mena ɛ, ye nabɛ ɛ́ ààbɛ, etɛɛ náá, mena needika bot ɛ bwoo, tin, Sisim djɛ mena ɛ́ ghwyil, kwyɛl nɛ ɛdil ɛ lyem.<verse eid="2TI 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 1:8" />Sa wɔ ààdi nɛ sen ɛgoola Mbɛɛ Bhaadal ɛ Ghɛŋ'enaka. Sa wɔ ààbaadi nɛ sen nɛ nam, mot di é membok kɔ ɛsu ɛ lɛ ɔ. Deenek, myaala ɛzuk sama nɛ nam étɛp Mbɛɛ Bhaadal. Tin, dia nɛ ɛbwaalel nɛ ghwyil Zɛɛb di edjɛ mena ɛ. <verse eid="2TI 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 1:9" />Nyɛy ɛ́ natsik mena, nɛ ɛsa náá, mena dika bot ɛ mbyak'ɛ. Ye nabɛ ɛ́ ààbɛ kɔ ɛsu ɛ enɛm esa bena, ye nabɛ ɛ́, kɔ ɛsu ɛ egeka bɛ met nɛ enɛm nɛ embee bɛ met. Tin, Zɛɛb nadjɛ mena enɛm nɛ embɛɛ binek ɛ, é ze ɛ Yezu Klisto, ɛsok nɛ nyɛ nɛkus bhwak. <verse eid="2TI 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 1:10" />Tin, ɛkɛɛ ɛ enɛm nɛ embɛɛ tak kazɛnyen mos ɛ́ é ɛtuula ɛ Mɛtsik-bot menaka Yezu Klisto. Nyɛy mot nakwak ɛsyee ɔ, yɛ ɛ́ dum nɛ Mbɛɛ Bhaadal ɛ nyɛ natel mena tsik na kɔm-kɔm.<verse eid="2TI 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 1:11" />Zɛɛb naadjɛ mɛ mɛsa mɛ ɛdi mot-lwoma nɛ lyoel, étɛp ɛkɛgoola Mbɛɛ Bhaadal. <verse eid="2TI 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 1:12" />Kɔ ɛsu ɛ tak ɛ, mɛ di ebee mezuk mɛ mɛ di ezuk'aak. Mɛ tok nɛ sen étɛp tak, etɛɛ náá, mɛ nɛ gu mot mɛ wa ɛbwaalel ɛ lam nɛ nɛ ɔ ɛnyɔɛpe. Tin, mɛ ɛpemyaal náá, Zɛɛb ɛ́ nɛ ghwyil ɛbaal sa nyɛ nadjɛ mɛ ɛ kɛkum dwoo epɛ́ɛ.<verse eid="2TI 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 1:13" />Deenek, mɛkpa mɛ etsɛɛtsɛ wɔ nagwak nɛ nam ɛ, yɛ ɛ́ mɛkpa mɛ wɔ di goka nɛ ɛkɛ nɛ yɛ tɔ tsik'ɔ ɛ. Tin, pyeta tɔ ɛdum ɛ koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb, kwyɛla bot nɛ kwyɛl di edus pɛ daa Yezu Klisto ɛ. <verse eid="2TI 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 1:14" />Deenek, baala mbɛɛ mɛlyo djas nazedjɛaa wɔ nɛ ghwyil Sisim na Dɛɛ di tɔ lena ɛ.<verse eid="2TI 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Esosoob ɛ Onezifɔɔd nɛ yii bot ɛ mɛbyel mɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 1:15" />Wɔ nɛ gu náá, bot ɛ kyee dik Azi djas naazekaab mɛ, tɔ sama bot ɛ tak, ye nabɛ ɛ́ nɛ Fizɛl bɛ nɛ Ɛɛmozɛn. <verse eid="2TI 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 1:16" />Beta náá, Ghɛŋ sa enɛm esa bɛ nɛ bot ɛ mɛbyel ɛ Onezifɔɔd, etɛɛ náá, nyɛ naadyeebadjɛ mɛ mɛghaaz. Tin, nyɛ nabɛ ɛ́ ààgwak sen nɛ nam, mam mot membok. <verse eid="2TI 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 1:17" />Deenek, dáa nyɛ natuula tɔ ghaada Lɔm ɛ, nyɛ naawa zii é ɛsaŋ ɛ mɛ, batakɛbela mɛ. <verse eid="2TI 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TI 1:18" />Tin, beta náá, Ghɛŋ sa náá, nyɛ bela enɛm esa e Zɛɛb nɛ dwoo epɛ́ɛ. Wɔy ɛmet nɛ baagu ɛnyɔɛpe esa djas nyɛ nasa nɛ nam pɛ kyee dik Efɛɛz ɛ.<verse eid="2TI 1:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2TI 2" />
  <para style="s">Mɛlyo dum nɛ dáa mot di egoka nɛ ɛdi mbɛɛ sodja ɛ Klisto ɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 2:1" />Wɔy, mɔn'am, dia nɛ ghwyil tɔ enɛm nɛ embɛɛ ee di edus pɛ daa Yezu Klisto ɛ. <verse eid="2TI 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 2:2" />Mɛlyo mɛ wɔ nadi egwak mɛ egoola é mis mɛ bɛtɛ nɛ bɛtyaasɛs ɛ, deenek, lyoa yɛ nɛ bɛtɛtɛ bot, bot aadi nɛ ghwyil ɛ́ baagoola lyo bɛdhiiti bot ɔ.<verse eid="2TI 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 2:3" />Myaala mezuk sama nɛ nam dhatyee mbɛɛ sodja ɛ Yezu Klisto. <verse eid="2TI 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 2:4" />Mot di náá, nyɛ dinaa kuku ɛsa mɛsa mɛ esodja ɔ, nyɛ kwyɛl náá, kukuma yɛ myaala nɛ nɛ ɔɔ, sa nyɛ ààbaasa dhiiti mɛsa mɛ sis. <verse eid="2TI 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 2:5" />Yɛ ɛ́ tyee wat nɛ mot di esa mɛboola mɛ ɛwyis ɛ kaab ɔ. Nyɛ aabela efute ɛ́, nyɛ sa dáa mɛtiŋ mɛ mɛboola mɛ tak di elɛɛ ɛ. <verse eid="2TI 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 2:6" />Mbɛel mɛbhek di ezuk ɛlyelɛpe é ɛsa mɛsa mɛ pyeeb'ɛ ɔ, goka ɛ́ nɛ ɛdi mot mɛkɛn aadɛ edee nyɛ nabɛ ɛ. <verse eid="2TI 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 2:7" />Siiza ɛnyɔɛpe sa mɛ di elɛɛ wɔ ɛ, deenek, Ghɛŋ ɛ́ waasa náá, wɔ mɛt etɛp djas.<verse eid="2TI 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 2:8" />Taala Yezu Klisto, dha ɛ Dhavid, mot nagom bhis ɛsyee ɔ, dáa Mbɛɛ Bhaadal mɛ di egoola ɛ di elɛɛ. <verse eid="2TI 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 2:9" />Yɛ ɛ́ kɔ ɛsu ɛ Mbɛɛ Bhaadal'ak ɛ mɛ di ezuk, kɔ ɛsu ɛ tak ɛ mɛ di kɔɔla, dáa mot sa mbee etɛp ɛ. Tin, Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb tok kɔɔla! <verse eid="2TI 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 2:10" />Étɛp tak ɛ́, mɛ di emaad etɛp djas kɔ ɛsu ɛ bot ɛ Zɛɛb nazesɛ́ɛ ɔ. Mɛ sa deenek ɛ́, etɛɛ náá, bot ɛ Zɛɛb nazesɛ́ɛ ɔ, neebela tsik nɛ duu na kɔm-kɔm di edus pɛ daa Yezu Klisto ɛ. <verse eid="2TI 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 2:11" />Yɛ ɛ́ embɛɛ ɛ mɛkpa mɛ etsɛɛtsɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2TI 2:11">«Mena gwyɛka sama wat nɛ Klisto ɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2TI 2:11">mena waadika nɛ tsik sama wat nɛ nɛ.<verse eid="2TI 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 2:12" />Mena pyetka ɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2TI 2:12">mena waakɔkeka sama nɛ nɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2TI 2:12">Mena byenka nyɛ ɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2TI 2:12">nyɛy pe ɛ́, waabyen mena.<verse eid="2TI 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 2:13" />Mena di ààdika sosoob ɔɔ, nyɛy ɛ́ aazodi ɛ́ sosoob,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2TI 2:13">etɛɛ náá, nyɛy tok nɛ ghwyil ɛswonal mɛkpa mɛ nuub'ɛ<note caller="*" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 23:19">Ɛla 23.19</ref></char></note>.»<verse eid="2TI 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mot-mɛsa mɛ Zɛɛb di ekwyɛl ɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 2:14" />Baagheelelɛɛ etɛp bak nɛ bot, dula bɛ mɛlo é mis ɛ Zɛɛb náá, sa bɛ ààsuu mɛso kɔ ɛsu ɛ mɛkpa mɛ bot di elóo ɛ. Ɛsuu mɛso menek ɛ́ ààval sa wat, mbi yenek saŋ ɛ́ ɛsaab esisim e bot ɛ di egwak ɔ. <verse eid="2TI 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 2:15" />Saŋa náá, wɔ di piki é mis ɛ Zɛɛb, dáa mot-mɛsa di ààbɛ nɛ sen é ɛgoola Mbɛɛ Bhaadal etsɛɛtsɛ ɛnyɔɛpe ɛ. <verse eid="2TI 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 2:16" />Kyeea embee melɛŋ di ebyasal ɛdum ɛ koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb ɛ, etɛɛ náá, bot ɛ di esa deenek ɔ ɛpebɛka nɛ Zɛɛb. <verse eid="2TI 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 2:17" />Mɛlyo mɔɔ ɛpebel epuud dáa pyoŋ zeni ɛgwyin ɛ. Tin, yɛ ɛ́ tyee wat nɛ Yimɛnɛ nɛ Filɛtus, <verse eid="2TI 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TI 2:18" />bɛ naazebɛka nɛ etsɛɛtsɛ. Bot binɔk eezepul ɛdum ɛ koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb bɛdhiiti bot nadi nɛ yɛ ɛ, nɛ ɛlyo bot náá, Zɛɛb naazegomal bot tɔ ɛsyee.<verse eid="2TI 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2TI 2:19" />Bela náá, epap nalyel-lyel ee Zɛɛb nasum ɛ ɛpepyet ɛnyɔɛpe, mɛkpa mak ɛ́ kwyala kɔ tak: «Ghɛŋ nɛ gu bɔn bɛ<note caller="*" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 16:5">Ɛla 16.5</ref></char></note>», tin, «Mot di eke náá, nyɛ ɛ́ mot ɛ́ Ghɛŋ ɔ, nyɛ goka ɛ́ nɛ ɛliig koŋ nɛ ɛbiyo.»<verse eid="2TI 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2TI 2:20" />Tɔ boo ndjaa, yɛ ɛ́ aanàkwaazodi esowa e lɔɔd nɛ yii eghwooz epata toto. Yɛ aabaadi ɛ́, nɛ yii di kpakaa nɛ le ɛ, dɔɔ nɛ yii dyak. Bɛdhiiti kwomaa ɛ́ étɛp mɛbyoŋ mɛ bot ɛ ghoŋ, bɛdhiiti étɛp ɛbeaa mɛlu djas. <verse eid="2TI 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2TI 2:21" />Tin, mot ɛ dis edhuud e embee etɛp binek djas ɔɔ, mot tak aadi ɛ́ dáa esowa e ghoŋ di ebeaa dwoo mɛbyoŋ ɛ. Nyɛ eezeso nyel'ɛ djas é mɛsa mɛ kukuma yɛ, é di'enek, nyɛ moo ɛ́ mbɛɛ mot, nyɛ ɛ́ nɛ ghwyil ɛkasa tɛtɛ esesɛɛ.<verse eid="2TI 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2TI 2:22" />Timote, kyeea embee egwyes e engbaaz, kɛa tɔ epiki, nɛ ɛdum ɛ koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb, nɛ kwyɛl, nɛ egwyem nɛ bot ɛ di eduwal Ghɛŋ nɛ lyem wat ɔ. <verse eid="2TI 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2TI 2:23" />Tin, sa wɔ ààsuu mɛso dum nɛ etɛp di ààbɛ nɛ lo mɛsɔ ɛ, etɛɛ náá, wɔ nɛ gu náá, ɛdjóo ɛ́ mɛwɔ. <verse eid="2TI 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2TI 2:24" />É di'enek, mot-mɛsa ɛ Ghɛŋ ɛ́ ààgoka nɛ ɛdi tɔ mɛwɔ. Nyɛ goka ɛ́ nɛ ɛdi nɛ kwyɛl nɛ bot djas, nɛ ghwyil ɛlyo bot, nɛ ɛmaad ɛ lyem. <verse eid="2TI 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2TI 2:25" />Ye goka ɛ́ náá, nyɛ lyo bot ɛ mɛso tɔ mɛtela, nɛghu Zɛɛb ɛ́ nɛ ghwyil ɛdjɛ bɛ ɛwala di náá, bɛ waaswoola mɛfulu mɔɔ, da gu etsɛɛtsɛ ɛ. <verse eid="2TI 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2TI 2:26" />Deenek, bɛ waabula tɔ embɛɛ mɛfulu mɔɔ, da bɛ ɛ́ dus é laab ɛ dim mot mɛkɔŋ, mot nazewa bɛ é membok étɛp bɛ neesesa mɛsa mɛ ɔ.<verse eid="2TI 2:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2TI 3" />
  <para style="s">Mezuk mɛ mɛlu mɛ mɛsik</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 3:1" />Gua ɛnyɔɛpe náá, é mɛlu mɛ mɛsik, yɛ aadi ɛ́ nɛ mɛlu mɛ di elyel ɛ. <verse eid="2TI 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 3:2" />Etɛɛ náá, bot aanàkagwyena, bot aakadi ɛ́ nɛ elyem tɔp tɔ epata, bot ɛghɛɛa nyel, bot ɛ ɛbet, bot ɛ́ waabyasal Zɛɛb, bɛ aanàkaab bɛbyael bɔɔ, bot aanàkwaamyaal bot, bɛ aanàduwal etɛp di náá, yɛ ɛ́ dɛɛ ɛ. <verse eid="2TI 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 3:3" />Bot ɛ tak aadi ɛ́, ààbɛ nɛ lyem kwyɛl, ààbɛ nɛ lyem ghoŋ, bot ɛ mɛbhekel, bot ɛ di ekwyɛ lyem ɔ, bot ɛ di nɛ lyem kyet ɔ, bot ɛ di ààkwyɛl enɛm esa ɔ. <verse eid="2TI 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 3:4" />Bot ɛ endumta, bot ɛ di ebiyo mbɛs ɔ, bot ɛ ɛghɛɛa nyel, bɛ waakwyɛl mɛnyɔ mɛ etɛp e bɔs dhaa yii Zɛɛb. <verse eid="2TI 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 3:5" />Bot binɔk sa ɛ́ ɛkɛɛ náá, bɛ ɛpedum koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb, ghuna yɛ ɛ́ bot ɛ di ààmyaal ghwyil di tɔ ɛdum ɛ koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb ɛ. É di'enek, dia ɛtsetaɛpe nɛ mbi binɔk bot!<verse eid="2TI 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 3:6" />Bɛdhiiti bot pak'ɔɔ ɛ́ nɛ mɛfulu mɛ ɛni tɔ mendjaa me bot, étɛp ɛkɔɔ boa di ààbɛ nɛ etsoŋ ɔ. Bɛ sa deenek ɛ́, étɛp boa tak neegwak bɛ. Boa tak ɛ́, boa di àànyɔ ɛtiibal ɔ, boa ɛ di tɔ tsik mesyem ɔ, bɛ nɛ dyeebakwyɛl esa e tsik epuud di ekwyɛl ɛ djas. <verse eid="2TI 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 3:7" />Mɛlu djas, boa tak ɛ ɛpesaa ɛgu sonok, tin, bɛ aanàkwaakogu etsɛɛtsɛ. <verse eid="2TI 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 3:8" />Yɛ ɛ́ dáa bot tyee Zanɛs nɛ Zambɛlɛs nadi ebyen lek ɛ Moiiz ɛ, yɛ ɛ́ deenek ɛ́ bot binɔk di ebaabyen etsɛɛtsɛ. Yɛ ɛ́ bot ɛ mbee mɛpek, ɛdum ɛ koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb tokapɛ vaŋ sonok é mis mɔɔ. <verse eid="2TI 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 3:9" />Tin, bɛ tok nɛ ghwyil ɛtɔ́ nɛ yɛ ɛtsetaɛpe, etɛɛ náá, bot djas ɛ́ waagu ewo bɔɔ, dáa yii Zanɛs nɛ Zambɛlɛs.<verse eid="2TI 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mɛlyo mɛ mɛsik</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 3:10" />Yɛ kabɛ wɔy Timote ɔɔ, wɔ bɛ ɛ́ wɔ eegwak mɛlyo mam ɛnyɔɛpe, wɔ eebee mɛfulu mam, mɛsa mɛ mɛ di ekwyɛl ɛsa ɛ, ɛdum ɛ koŋ ɛ lam nɛ Zɛɛb, ɛmaad ɛ lyem'am, kwyɛl'am, nɛ zii'am, <verse eid="2TI 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 3:11" />wɔ eebee mɛtiiga mɛ bɛ di etiig mɛ ɛ, dɔɔ nɛ mezuk mam. Wɔ nɛ gu etɛp djas mɛ naboma nɛ yɛ pɛ ghaada Antiɔs ɛ, pɛ tɔ ghaada Ikoniɔm nɛ pɛ tɔ ghaada Lisetɛ ɛ. Wɔ nɛ gu mezuk mɛ mɛ naboma nɛ yɛ ɛ. Tin, Ghɛŋ nabɛ ɛ́, nyɛ naapɛk mɛ tɔ etɛp binek djas. <verse eid="2TI 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 3:12" />Tsɛɛtsɛ, mot djas di ekwyɛl ɛdi sosoob nɛ Zɛɛb, tɔ ɛgwakel nɛ Yezu Klisto ɔ, nyɛ waatiigaa. <verse eid="2TI 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 3:13" />Tin, bot ɛ mbee lyem nɛ bot ɛ etsal, bɛ waatɔ́ sok tɔ embee mɛsa mɔɔ, bɛ waakɔɔ bɛsɔ bɔɔ. É di'enek, é mɛsik mɛ tak, bɛ ɛ́ waakɔɔ mɛnyel mɔɔ met. <verse eid="2TI 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 3:14" />Yɛ kabɛ wɔy ɔɔ, baala mɛdjek mɛ wɔ nadjek ɛ, myaala yɛ nɛ lyem wat. Wɔ nɛ gu bɛlyoel ɛ wɔ nadjek pɛ daa lɔɔ ɔ. <verse eid="2TI 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 3:15" />Kana edhɔma bɔ, wɔ nɛ gu Ekwyala na Dɛɛ. Yɛ ɛ́ nɛ ghwyil ɛdjɛ wɔ etsoŋ ee di edjɛ mot tsik tɔ ɛdum ɛ koŋ nɛ Yezu Klisto ɛ. <verse eid="2TI 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 3:16" />Tɔ Ekwyala na Dɛɛ djas, yɛ ɛ́ Zɛɛb ɛ nadjɛ bot etsoŋ e ɛkwyal ɛ yɛ. Yɛ ɛ́ nɛ boo mɛtaŋ étɛp ɛlyo bot etsɛɛtsɛ, nɛ ɛlyaal ɛ́ mot ɛdjak ɛ lɛ, nɛ ɛbulal ɛ́ bot ɛ nasa ɛbiyo ɔ é ze, dɔɔ nɛ ɛlyaal ɛ mot tsik Zɛɛb di ekwyɛl ɛ. <verse eid="2TI 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 3:17" />Ekwyala na Dɛɛ binek nakwyalaa ɛ́ etɛɛ mot-mɛsa ɛ Zɛɛb needi mot zedjala nɛ ɛsa ɛ mɛsa ɔ. Nyɛ needi mot di náá, nyɛ ɛ́ nɛ ghwyil ɛsa membi mɛ enɛm esa djas ɔ.<verse eid="2TI 3:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="2TI 4" />
  <para style="s">Ɛgoola Mbɛɛ Bhaadal</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 4:1" />Mɛ ɛpedjaala nɛ nɔ, é mis ɛ Zɛɛb nɛ é mis ɛ Yezu Klisto, mot aapɛ́ɛ bot ɛ di nɛ tsik, nɛ bot ɛ zegwyɛ ɔ, mɛ ɛpedjaala nɛ nɔ kɔ ɛsu ɛ ɛbula ɛ Yezu Klisto, nɛ kɔ ɛsu ɛ Ɛyoŋ ɛ lɛ: <verse eid="2TI 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 4:2" />Wa zii tɔ ɛgoola Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb, ye nakoozodi tɔ egwyem nɛghu tɔ ɛtap. Lyaka bot, dula mɛlɔ mɛ bot ɛ di esa ɛbiyo ɔ, djɛ bɛ mɛghaaz, nɛ ɛlyo bɛ tɔ ɛdil ɛ lyem. <verse eid="2TI 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 4:3" />Etɛɛ náá, yɛ aadi ɛ́ nɛ ɛwala di náá, bot aanàbaakwyɛl ɛgwak mbɛɛ mɛlyo ɛ. Tin, bɛ waasa membi mɛ mɛpek djas, étɛp ɛsa esa ee mɛkwosak mɛ elyem bɔɔ di ekwyɛl ɛ. Bɛ aadi ɛ́ nɛ bɛtɛ nɛ bɛmbee bɛlyoel ɛ aadi elyo bɛ etɛp ee elyem bɔɔ di ekwos ɛgwak ɛ. <verse eid="2TI 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 4:4" />É di'enek, bɛ waabyen ɛgwak etsɛɛtsɛ, étɛp ɛdu ɛ esesa e esua-esua. <verse eid="2TI 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 4:5" />Yɛ kabɛ wɔy ɔɔ, dila lyem sok bhwoob etɛp binek djas, maada lyem tɔ mezuk, wa zii é ɛgoola Mbɛɛ Bhaadal, silela mɛsa mɛ Zɛɛb djɛ wɔ ɛ.<verse eid="2TI 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 4:6" />Yɛ kabɛ mam ɔɔ, ɛwala di náá, ghiya yam neesee dáa buwa ɛ eezedjala, ɛwala ɛmwana nɛ bɔs'ak eezedjala. <verse eid="2TI 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 4:7" />Mɛ eeduu mbɛɛ tuub, mɛ eekɛkum pɛ ɛsik ɛ kaab mɛ napat ɛ, mɛ eebaal ɛdum ɛ koŋ ɛ lam nɛ Zɛɛb. <verse eid="2TI 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 4:8" />Nenak, efute ɛpebwood mɛ etɛɛ náá, mɛ eekwak. Efute tak ɛ́ kɔtɔ duu, yɛ ɛ́ kɔtɔ mot epiki. Yɛ ɛ́ nyɛy Ghɛŋ, mbɛɛ tetɛp ɛ kwaadjɛ mɛ yɛ é dwoo mɛpɛ́ɛa ɛ. Tin, nyɛ aanàkwaadjɛ mam ɛmet, nyɛ aadjɛ ɛ́ dɔɔ nɛ bot djas di egwaal nɛ lyem kwyɛl ɛwala ɛ nyɛ aatuula ɛ.<verse eid="2TI 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mɛlyo mɛ Pɔl pɛ daa Timote</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 4:9" />Tin, sa mɛghaaz etɛɛ náá, wɔ neeleezɛbela mɛ. <verse eid="2TI 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 4:10" />Dhemas naazekaab mɛ, etɛɛ náá lyem'ɛ ɛ́ tɔ kwyɛl esa e bɔs'ak. Nyɛ eetɔ́ pɛ ghaada Tesalonik. Yɛ kabɛ Kelesɔn ɔɔ, nyɛ eetɔ́ pɛ kyee dik Ghalasi. Tit naazetɔ́ yɛ pɛ ghaada Dhalmasi. <verse eid="2TI 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 4:11" />Luk nyɛ ɛmet ɛ́ kalik bis nɛ nɛ. É sok wɔ aazyɛ ɛ, dha bi nɛ Malak. Etɛɛ náá, nyɛ nɛ ghwyil ɛzɛkwyee mɛ tɔ mɛsa mɛ Zɛɛb. <verse eid="2TI 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 4:12" />Mɛ eelwom Tisik pɛ ghaada Efɛɛz. <verse eid="2TI 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 4:13" />É sok wɔ aazyɛ ɛ, da wɔ ɛ́ zyɛ mɛ nɛ ndjookuwa yam yii mɛ nalik pɛ ghaada Toloas pɛ tɔ ndjaŋ ɛ Kalpus ɛ. Tin, da wɔ ɛ́ baanɔɔ mɛ mɛkana mam, daŋ-daŋ ɛ mɛkana nasael nɛ eket e bɛtit ɛ. <figure style="fig" alt="Timothée est allé voir Paul dans la prison" file="cn02088C.tif" size="col" loc="4.13" copy="David C Cook" ref="4.13">Timote eekɛbee Pɔl é membok</figure><verse eid="2TI 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 4:14" />Alɛkzandɛlɛ, lulel eghwooz naadyeebasa mɛ ɛbiyo. Tin, Ghɛŋ nyɛ ɛmet waadjɛ nyɛ efute e mɛsa mɛ. <verse eid="2TI 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 4:15" />Tin, wɔ goka ɛ́ nɛ ɛbaadi nɛ etsoŋ nɛ nɛ, etɛɛ náá nyɛ nabɛ ɛ́, nyɛ dyeebabyen mɛlyo mɛ bis nadi elyo ɛ.<verse eid="2TI 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 4:16" />Tin, mot ngɔt nabɛ ɛ́ ààkɛm mɛ, é sok mɛ nadi etaŋal taŋal yam yii mɛkɛn ɛ, bot djas nakaab mɛ. Beta náá, Zɛɛb nàlaa syem tak kɔ lɔɔ. <verse eid="2TI 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 4:17" />Tin, Ghɛŋ naakwyee mɛ, nyɛ naadjɛ mɛ mɛghaaz! Wɔ gwaa, mɛ zɛgoola Mbɛɛ Bhaadal yɛ pɛ daa bot djas di ààbɛ tɔ mbyak eYuda ɔ. Ghɛŋ naapɛk mɛ tɔ nuub ghee. <verse eid="2TI 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TI 4:18" />Deenek, Ghɛŋ ɛ́ waabaapɛk mɛ tɔ embee etɛp djas. Tin, nyɛ waatsik mɛ, étɛp nyɛ neeniigal mɛ tɔ Ɛyoŋ ɛ lɛ di tɔ gwoo ɛ. Beta náá, duu di nɛ nɛ kɔm-kɔm sii nɛ kɔm! <char style="sc">Amɛn</char>!<verse eid="2TI 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mɛswosel mɛ mɛsik</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2TI 4:19" />Da wɔ ɛ́ swos Pilisil bɛ nɛ Akilas dɔɔ nɛ bot ɛ mɛbyel ɛ Onezifɔɔd. <verse eid="2TI 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2TI 4:20" />Eelasetɛ eelik pɛ ghaada Koolɛt. Tin, mɛ eelik Tolofim pɛ ghaada Milɛ, etɛɛ náá, nyel nadi ekpaa nyɛ. <verse eid="2TI 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2TI 4:21" />Deenek, sa mɛghaaz wɔ kum, ɛsok nɛ mbu bɛbhi nɛ kan. Ebulus, Pudɔɔ, Linus, Koloodya nɛ bɛdhiiti bɔn-nyoog, bɛ eeswos wɔ.<verse eid="2TI 4:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2TI 4:22" />Beta náá, Ghɛŋ di nɛ nɔ! Beta náá enɛm nɛ embɛɛ e Zɛɛb di nɛ nen!<verse eid="2TI 4:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 4" />
</usx>